        welcome:"Welcome", welcomeTitle:"Welcome", welcomeMessage:"We are an alliance in the game Last Asylum Plague, present on server 277 with a friendly environment, and we grow with every hard battle. Our group of friends works daily to improve, we laugh at everything we can and make mistakes, we strive with events at our level so everyone earns rewards, and in the difficult ones (to die!) after a hard fight we laugh about whether we win or not. We enjoy epic battles and remember the last 30 minutes of extreme madness, giving everything until the end.", youtubeLabel:"YouTube", rulesLabel:"UXM Rules",
        navHome:"Home", navDaily:"Daily Activities", navRules:"UXM Rules", navTutorials:"Video Tutorials", navStrategy:"Strategy", navContact:"Contact", visitTitle:"Visit our Alliance",
        arengaTitle:"War Cry", arengaMessage:"Beneath the most crushing flames,\nwhich darken our night and sanctuary,\nmonsters roam around me.\nwe will embrace our fear, we will do what is right...\n\nI choose this kingdom, I choose this battle once again...\nI will embrace my destiny because I want to believe in the light of my Alliance!\nI will carry hope within me...\n\nFor the silenced!,\nfor those who spent a week of blows!\nfor those wounded by fire!\nfor those who do not want to repeat this day!\nthey will hear my war drum approaching..\n\nBrothers, do not falter! You are the strength!\nYou are the blood of fury that moves my soldiers,\nyou are my friend, my ally, we will strike together!\nand you will feel the iron of my sword!!!\nfor Puppy and the Wild Cats!", tutoTitle:"Video Tutorials", tutorialsMessage:"Guide and help videos for the new members of the game, and some ideas to improve your heroes or hit harder hahaha.", strategyTitle:"Strategic Library", strategyMessage:"We will look for different ways to help; in this section we will gather the tactics we learn daily, organized by topics that fit your needs.", allianceTitle:"Visit our Alliance",
        allianceMessage:"Get to know our Alliance, we seek to help everyone on kingdom 277, you can even visit us on Sundays and use our building and research bonuses, let's improve together!!", bonusAlliance:"Alliance Technology Bonuses", bonusFastBuild:"Fast Build",
        bonusResearchSpeedup:"Research Speedup", bonusCraftingSpeedup:"Crafting Speedup", bonusFastTraining:"Fast Training",
        bonusRallyStats:"Rally HP/ATK/DEF", bonusShardExchange:"Shard Exchange Bank: for the treasures you need in covert operations.", bonusInProgress:"In Progress",
