        tutorialLearningPriorityTitle:"Priority Learning", tutorialTipsTitle:"Practical Tip", tutorialEventsTitle:"Events",
        videoTutorialPriority1:"Simple steps to withdraw the soldiers from the Wall in our Sanctuary, the effective way to NOT lose soldiers and AVOID giving points to the enemy on War Day (Saturday).",
        videoTutorialPriority2:"Steps to buy and activate a 24H shield or use the free 8H ones.",
        videoTutorialPriority3:"Raid Caravans and Secret Operations of other Kingdoms, avoid stealing resources in our kingdom 277.",
        videoTutorialTip1:"Request the official position of Minister in the Royal Court, bonuses from 25% to 60% in accelerators, the most important ones for Construction and Research.",
        videoTutorialTip2:"Send 1 caravan at a time with our strongest squad, minimizes raids, prefer sending SSR or UR rarity.",
        videoTutorialTip3:"Saturday day of Kingdom Wars or Alliance Duels, steps to jump to another kingdom and come back for free.",
        videoTutorialEvent1:"Alliance Event, Cheese Thief Lv.6. Goal per player of 225M damage, at least 1 player must reach 990M damage, to multiply the rewards by 10 (MVP 1).",
        videoTutorialEvent2:"Kingdom Event, Crystal Peaks Valley. Goal to mine 150K crystals, capture and mine crystal mounds, rats and minutes before the end go for the Sacred Cave.",
        videoTutorialEvent3:"Kingdom Event, Kingdom War for the Royal City. Goal 1.5M Honor Points, achieved by attacking or losing soldiers, many energy bottles are needed on War Day (Saturday).",
        videoTutorialEvent4:"Kingdom Alliance Event, Royal City of the Kingdom Uproar. Goal 150K Honor Points, achieved by capturing or defending crops, winning or losing soldiers also gives points with this peaceful way in the City Uproar (Friday).",
